{"unit_id": "tag:006W:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为拓扑空间（topological space）。设<MATH_0002>为集合（set）。\n<TEXTITOPEN_0001>常值层（constant sheaf with value），其值为<MATH_0003><TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，记作<MATH_0004>或<MATH_0005>。这是如下定义的层（sheaf）：对开集（open）<MATH_0006>，取由所有局部常值（locally constant）映射（maps）<MATH_0007>组成的集合（set），限制映射（restriction mappings）由函数（functions）的限制（restrictions）给出。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "constant sheaf with value", "target_term": "常值层"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开集"}, {"source_term": "locally constant", "target_term": "局部常值"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "restriction mappings", "target_term": "限制映射"}, {"source_term": "functions", "target_term": "函数"}, {"source_term": "restrictions", "target_term": "限制"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间", "context": "指定所讨论的空间"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合", "context": "作为常值层取值的集合"}, {"source_term": "constant sheaf with value", "target_term": "常值层", "context": "定义具有指定取值的常值层，取值在紧接的分句中给出"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "说明所定义对象的类型"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开集", "context": "层在其上取值的开集"}, {"source_term": "locally constant", "target_term": "局部常值", "context": "限定映射在每一点附近为常值"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射", "context": "构成开集上取值的映射"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合", "context": "由所有这些映射组成"}, {"source_term": "restriction mappings", "target_term": "限制映射", "context": "在不同开集上的取值之间给出限制"}, {"source_term": "functions", "target_term": "函数", "context": "施加限制的对象"}, {"source_term": "restrictions", "target_term": "限制", "context": "得到限制映射的操作"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:006X:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为拓扑空间（topological space）。设<MATH_0002>为集合（sets）<MATH_0003>组成的族（family），由点（points）<MATH_0004>索引。我们将用这些数据构造一个层（sheaf）<MATH_0005>，其取值为集合（sets）。\n对开集（open）<MATH_0006>，置（set）\n<MATH_0007>\n对开集（open）<MATH_0008>，按如下规则定义限制映射（restriction mapping）：元素（element）<MATH_0009>限制为<MATH_0010>。这显然定义了一个预层（presheaf），其取值为集合（sets）。我们断言它是层（sheaf）。\n具体而言，设<MATH_0011>为开覆盖（covering）。假设<MATH_0012>满足<MATH_0013>与<MATH_0014>在<MATH_0015>上一致。记\n<MATH_0016>。由相容性条件（compatibility condition）可知，<MATH_0017>在集合（set）<MATH_0018>中成立，只要<MATH_0019>。因此，存在唯一的元素（element）<MATH_0020>属于<MATH_0021>，使得<MATH_0022>在<MATH_0023>对某个<MATH_0024>成立时成立。当然，这个元素（element）<MATH_0025>满足<MATH_0026>，对所有<MATH_0027>均是如此。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "family", "target_term": "族"}, {"source_term": "points", "target_term": "点"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开集"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "置"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开集"}, {"source_term": "restriction mapping", "target_term": "限制映射"}, {"source_term": "element", "target_term": "元素"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "开覆盖"}, {"source_term": "compatibility condition", "target_term": "相容性条件"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "element", "target_term": "元素"}, {"source_term": "element", "target_term": "元素"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间", "context": "给出索引点所在的空间"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合", "context": "族中各项的类型"}, {"source_term": "family", "target_term": "族", "context": "用索引组织给定集合"}, {"source_term": "points", "target_term": "点", "context": "用于索引集合"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "要构造的对象"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合", "context": "所构造的层的取值类型"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开集", "context": "作为取值的自变量"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "置", "context": "动词，用于给出定义"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开集", "context": "指定限制映射涉及的开集"}, {"source_term": "restriction mapping", "target_term": "限制映射", "context": "按给出的规则定义的映射"}, {"source_term": "element", "target_term": "元素", "context": "限制映射的输入"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层", "context": "由取值与限制映射定义的对象"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合", "context": "所得预层的取值类型"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "断言所得预层满足的性质"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "开覆盖", "context": "此处指用来验证层条件的开覆盖"}, {"source_term": "compatibility condition", "target_term": "相容性条件", "context": "各局部数据在交集上一致的条件"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合", "context": "比较局部数据时所在的集合"}, {"source_term": "element", "target_term": "元素", "context": "存在且唯一的拼合结果"}, {"source_term": "element", "target_term": "元素", "context": "核验各限制时指代拼合结果"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:006Y:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为拓扑空间（topological space）。\n假设对每个<MATH_0002>都给定一个阿贝尔群（abelian group）<MATH_0003>。\n考虑预层（presheaf）<MATH_0004>，它由例<REF_0001>定义。它一般不是层（sheaf）。例如，若<MATH_0005>是一个无限（infinite）集合（set），带有离散（discrete）拓扑（topology），则层条件（sheaf condition）将推出<MATH_0006>，而按定义有<MATH_0007>。无限（infinite）直和（direct sum）一般不同于无限（infinite）直积（product）。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n不过，若<MATH_0008>是一个拓扑空间（topological space），且<MATH_0009>的每个开集（open）都是拟紧（quasi-compact）的，则<MATH_0010><TEXTITOPEN_0001>是<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>层（sheaf）。这留给读者作为练习。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间"}, {"source_term": "abelian group", "target_term": "阿贝尔群"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "infinite", "target_term": "无限"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "discrete", "target_term": "离散"}, {"source_term": "topology", "target_term": "拓扑"}, {"source_term": "sheaf condition", "target_term": "层条件"}, {"source_term": "infinite", "target_term": "无限"}, {"source_term": "direct sum", "target_term": "直和"}, {"source_term": "infinite", "target_term": "无限"}, {"source_term": "product", "target_term": "直积"}, {"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开集"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间", "context": "指定初始空间"}, {"source_term": "abelian group", "target_term": "阿贝尔群", "context": "对每个点给定的群"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层", "context": "所引用的构造"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "所引用的预层一般不满足的性质"}, {"source_term": "infinite", "target_term": "无限", "context": "限定反例中的集合"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合", "context": "反例的底集"}, {"source_term": "discrete", "target_term": "离散", "context": "限定所用的拓扑"}, {"source_term": "topology", "target_term": "拓扑", "context": "赋予无限集合的结构"}, {"source_term": "sheaf condition", "target_term": "层条件", "context": "推导反例所用的条件"}, {"source_term": "infinite", "target_term": "无限", "context": "限定直和"}, {"source_term": "direct sum", "target_term": "直和", "context": "与直积比较的构造"}, {"source_term": "infinite", "target_term": "无限", "context": "限定直积"}, {"source_term": "product", "target_term": "直积", "context": "此处指与直和比较的直积"}, {"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间", "context": "陈述开集拟紧的充分条件时所讨论的空间"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开集", "context": "对其逐一要求拟紧性"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧", "context": "空间中每个开集须满足的条件"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "在给定条件下所得预层具有的性质"}], "notes": []}
