{"unit_id": "tag:0070:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为拓扑空间（topological space）。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002><TEXTITOPEN_0001><MATH_0002>上的阿贝尔层（abelian sheaf）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，或称<TEXTITOPEN_0002><MATH_0003>上的阿贝尔群层（sheaf of abelian groups）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>，是<MATH_0004>上的阿贝尔（abelian）预层（presheaf），且其底层预层（presheaf）（取值于集合（sets））是层（sheaf）。\n<STRUCT_0003>用<MATH_0005>表示这样一个范畴（category），其对象为层（sheaves），取值于阿贝尔群（abelian groups）。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间"}, {"source_term": "abelian sheaf", "target_term": "阿贝尔层"}, {"source_term": "sheaf of abelian groups", "target_term": "阿贝尔群层"}, {"source_term": "abelian", "target_term": "阿贝尔"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "abelian groups", "target_term": "阿贝尔群"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间", "context": "给出定义所用的空间"}, {"source_term": "abelian sheaf", "target_term": "阿贝尔层", "context": "被定义的对象"}, {"source_term": "sheaf of abelian groups", "target_term": "阿贝尔群层", "context": "所定义对象的另一名称"}, {"source_term": "abelian", "target_term": "阿贝尔", "context": "限定作为定义起点的预层的类型"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层", "context": "作为定义起点的对象"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层", "context": "忘掉阿贝尔群结构后的底层对象"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合", "context": "底层预层的取值类型"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "对底层预层要求的性质"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴", "context": "为阿贝尔群层所在的范畴指定记号"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层", "context": "所指定范畴的对象"}, {"source_term": "abelian groups", "target_term": "阿贝尔群", "context": "这些层的取值类型"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:006Z:prose-0001", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n设<MATH_0001>为拓扑空间（topological space）。\n对于阿贝尔（abelian）预层（presheaf）<MATH_0002>，层条件（sheaf condition）就开覆盖（covering）<MATH_0003>而言，常表述为如下复形（complex）（由阿贝尔群（abelian groups）组成）\n<MATH_0004>\n是正合（exact）的。第一个映射（map）是通常的那个映射，第二个则把元素（element）<MATH_0005>映到（maps）元素（element）\n<MATH_0006>\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间"}, {"source_term": "abelian", "target_term": "阿贝尔"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "sheaf condition", "target_term": "层条件"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "开覆盖"}, {"source_term": "complex", "target_term": "复形"}, {"source_term": "abelian groups", "target_term": "阿贝尔群"}, {"source_term": "exact", "target_term": "正合"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "element", "target_term": "元素"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映到"}, {"source_term": "element", "target_term": "元素"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间", "context": "预层所在的空间"}, {"source_term": "abelian", "target_term": "阿贝尔", "context": "限定预层的取值类型"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层", "context": "讨论其层条件的对象"}, {"source_term": "sheaf condition", "target_term": "层条件", "context": "以复形正合来表述的条件"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "开覆盖", "context": "此处指该层条件所对应的开覆盖"}, {"source_term": "complex", "target_term": "复形", "context": "用来表述层条件的复形"}, {"source_term": "abelian groups", "target_term": "阿贝尔群", "context": "构成复形的对象"}, {"source_term": "exact", "target_term": "正合", "context": "复形满足的性质"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "指复形中的第一个映射"}, {"source_term": "element", "target_term": "元素", "context": "第二个映射的输入"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映到", "context": "动词，给出第二个映射对输入的作用"}, {"source_term": "element", "target_term": "元素", "context": "第二个映射的输出"}], "notes": []}
